//@version=6
// v10.20.2: runtime-safe TAKE BUY causal-validation build.
// Trading execution is preserved; only duplicated dashboard projections and
// legacy shadow arrays were removed from the main body to stay below Pine's
// execution-scope limit.
strategy("TRINITY v10.20.2 TAKE BUY RUNTIME SAFE [OLEZHKA]", "TRINITY S10.20.2 SAFE", overlay = true, pyramiding = 0, initial_capital = 10000, currency = currency.USD, commission_type = strategy.commission.percent, commission_value = 0.06, slippage = 1, process_orders_on_close = true, calc_on_order_fills = false, calc_on_every_tick = false, max_labels_count = 500, max_lines_count = 300, max_bars_back = 5000)
// Research indicator. Signals are confirmed only on the closing update of a bar.
// Architecture: peak-held exhaustion creates an event; adaptive effort-response
// modeling measures whether the attacking auction still moves price efficiently.
// A latent TURN is followed by a probabilistic TAKEOVER with entropy contraction.
// Structural transfer remains an independent early route, not a mandatory gate.
// v7.0 changes the decision variable: TURN measures loss of response efficiency
// by the attacking side; TAKEOVER measures disproportionate response by the
// opponent. Signals come from causal response change, not REV/CONT classification.
// v10.0 converts every critical IDX episode into one causal state machine:
// ARMED -> DECAY -> DEFENSE -> VICTORY or CANCEL. Legacy routes remain as
// evidence sensors and as an A/B control mode, but cannot compete with each
// other when the Exhaustion Victory Engine is selected.
// Kalman/FLI are visual context only and never create BUY/SELL by themselves.
// v10.12 activates only the pre-registered 15-minute Tail Recovery De-Risk
// rule validated on BTC, ETH and SOL. BUY/SELL discovery, graphical signals,
// initial position size, logical SL, catastrophe SL and TP remain unchanged.
// A weak bar-8 tail is armed, then 25% is closed only if bar 12 confirms that
// recovery failed. The service exit is excluded from Capital Intelligence so
// the remaining trade's normal final result alone updates side memory.
// v10.17 keeps the confirmed BUY/SELL discovery, SL, TP and sizing mathematics
// intact. It changes admission only: an EVE VICTORY may execute inside a fixed
// causal window after the episode's first PRICE DEFENSE. A stale VICTORY remains
// visible as a grey shadow signal but cannot open or reverse a position. The
// former flat-lead execution lane is disabled; its observatory remains telemetry.
//=============================================================================
// Inputs
//=============================================================================
